360	    // ── SPEC-CLI-001d AC-001: a --config path containing quote/backslash
361	    // characters or the literal `');process.exit(1);('` sequence must not be
362	    // interpretable as JavaScript syntax — the path is passed via the
363	    // __DOCGEN_CONFIG_PATH env var, never concatenated into the script string
364	    // handed to node. This is the one security-relevant criterion in the
365	    // whole spec-drift review that had zero test coverage; the mechanism was
366	    // previously verified by source inspection only.
